{"api_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/24744","collected_at":"2026-09-27T21:56:07.082939+00:00","comments":[{"author_association":"MEMBER","body":"CC @egebeysel \n","created_at":"2026-07-22T14:42:24Z","html_url":"https://github.com/iree-org/iree/issues/24744#issuecomment-5047590688","id":5047590688,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/24744","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDODGgK6M8AAAABLNwfIA","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/comments/5047590688/reactions"},"updated_at":"2026-07-22T14:42:24Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/comments/5047590688","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99926684?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FedericoBruzzone/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FedericoBruzzone/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FedericoBruzzone/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FedericoBruzzone/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/FedericoBruzzone","id":99926684,"login":"FedericoBruzzone","node_id":"U_kgDOBfTCnA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FedericoBruzzone/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FedericoBruzzone/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FedericoBruzzone/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FedericoBruzzone/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FedericoBruzzone/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FedericoBruzzone","user_view_type":"public"}}],"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"author_association":"MEMBER","body":"Compiling a plain `linalg.matmul` with `--iree-opt-data-tiling=true` **and** `--iree-llvmcpu-disable-distribution=true` produces a matmul dispatch whose inner tile loop contains a `memref.alloca` that is **not hoisted out of the loop and never freed inside it**. The stack pointer is decremented every iteration with no restore, so the worker-thread stack grows unboundedly and overflows (`EXC_BAD_ACCESS`) once the tile count is large enough. Small matmuls run fine; large ones crash.\n\n## Repro\n\n`matmul_8192.mlir`:\n```mlir\nfunc.func @matmul(%A: tensor<8192x8192xf32>, %B: tensor<8192x8192xf32>, %C: tensor<8192x8192xf32>) -> tensor<8192x8192xf32> {\n  %0 = linalg.matmul ins(%A, %B : tensor<8192x8192xf32>, tensor<8192x8192xf32>)\n                     outs(%C : tensor<8192x8192xf32>) -> tensor<8192x8192xf32>\n  return %0 : tensor<8192x8192xf32>\n}\n```\n\n```bash\niree-compile matmul_8192.mlir \\\n  --iree-hal-target-backends=llvm-cpu \\\n  --iree-llvmcpu-target-cpu=apple-m4 \\\n  --iree-opt-data-tiling=true \\\n  --iree-llvmcpu-disable-distribution=true \\\n  -o matmul_8192.vmfb\n\niree-run-module --module=matmul_8192.vmfb --function=matmul \\\n  --input=8192x8192xf32 --input=8192x8192xf32 --input=8192x8192xf32\n```\n\nExpected:\n```\nEXEC @matmul\n[1]    40218 bus error  iree-run-module --module=matmul_8192.vmfb \n```\n\n## This is a regression folks :D\n\nThe leaking in-loop `alloca` is generated by a **recent compiler** but not by an older release:\n\n| compiler | date  | runs |\n|---|---|:---:|\n| release `3.11.0rc20260316` @ `e4a3b0405d` | 2026-03-16 | OK |\n| `main` @ `4b11e1da59b1` | 2026-07-16 | **crash** |\n\n","closed_at":"2026-07-24T06:40:35Z","closed_by":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74309236?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/egebeysel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/egebeysel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/egebeysel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/egebeysel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":